    "detailed_description": "<strong>- This game offers full compatibility between mouse &amp; keyboard controls and VR operation. You can enjoy the entire experience without a VR setup. -</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Encounters. Infinite Desire. Build the Harem of Your Dreams.</h2>Succubi of every shape, size, and flavor await\u2014each with their own seductive charm. From faces and hairstyles to height, curves, skin tones, and sultry eyes, every detail is yours to indulge in. Find the ones that match your deepest cravings, and create the ultimate harem tailored to your taste.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/6c6e68c1028249fe86fb7eef40ae2306.poster.avif?t=1755043054\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/6c6e68c1028249fe86fb7eef40ae2306.webm?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/6c6e68c1028249fe86fb7eef40ae2306.mp4?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Touch. Tease. Take Control. \u2014 Unleash Unlimited Freedom with Full Physics</h2>No pre-made animations\u2014just pure, reactive motion. Thanks to full physics simulation, every movement is fluid, unique, and deliciously unpredictable. Summon as many succubi as your machine can handle, then grab, pose, and position them exactly how you like using nothing but your mouse. Every interaction is yours to command.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/357905084c57870ebaa549a39aa5193e.poster.avif?t=1755043054\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/357905084c57870ebaa549a39aa5193e.webm?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/357905084c57870ebaa549a39aa5193e.mp4?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >She Thinks. She Feels. She Wants You. \u2014 Succubi with Minds of Their Own</h2>These aren\u2019t mindless dolls. Each succubus roams the map on her own, guided by goal-driven AI. She\u2019ll seductively engage enemies, drift through danger, and at times come running back to you\u2014needing your help, your touch. Her expressions shift with the moment, adding raw emotion and irresistible allure to her every move.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/2702246b2c0d061909df19fb28e5fcce.poster.avif?t=1755043054\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/2702246b2c0d061909df19fb28e5fcce.webm?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/2702246b2c0d061909df19fb28e5fcce.mp4?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shed Reality. Slip into Pleasure. \u2014 Instantly Switch Between Display and VR</h2>Start in the comfort of your screen, then dive deep into a world of sensual VR with a single touch. Switch freely at any time\u2014no interruptions, no limits. Seamless controls let you surrender to a pleasure-rich fantasy whenever the urge strikes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/4d46572c6c371e20035a025945c87a3e.poster.avif?t=1755043054\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/4d46572c6c371e20035a025945c87a3e.webm?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/4d46572c6c371e20035a025945c87a3e.mp4?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>* When playing in VR, the game is designed for seated play. A head-mounted display replaces the monitor, and a single VR controller is used instead of a keyboard and mouse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story \u2014 The Slick Rescue of Desire Begins.</h2>You\u2019re a carefree slime, enjoying steamy days with your playful succubi. But everything changes when a dark realm engulfs their village. Only a teleport crystal remains. Now, it\u2019s up to you to bring them back\u2014one by one\u2014and rebuild your dripping, decadent harem.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>- This game offers full compatibility between mouse &amp; keyboard controls and VR operation. You can enjoy the entire experience without a VR setup. -</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Encounters. Infinite Desire. Build the Harem of Your Dreams.</h2>Succubi of every shape, size, and flavor await\u2014each with their own seductive charm. From faces and hairstyles to height, curves, skin tones, and sultry eyes, every detail is yours to indulge in. Find the ones that match your deepest cravings, and create the ultimate harem tailored to your taste.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/6c6e68c1028249fe86fb7eef40ae2306.poster.avif?t=1755043054\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/6c6e68c1028249fe86fb7eef40ae2306.webm?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/6c6e68c1028249fe86fb7eef40ae2306.mp4?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Touch. Tease. Take Control. \u2014 Unleash Unlimited Freedom with Full Physics</h2>No pre-made animations\u2014just pure, reactive motion. Thanks to full physics simulation, every movement is fluid, unique, and deliciously unpredictable. Summon as many succubi as your machine can handle, then grab, pose, and position them exactly how you like using nothing but your mouse. Every interaction is yours to command.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/357905084c57870ebaa549a39aa5193e.poster.avif?t=1755043054\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/357905084c57870ebaa549a39aa5193e.webm?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/357905084c57870ebaa549a39aa5193e.mp4?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >She Thinks. She Feels. She Wants You. \u2014 Succubi with Minds of Their Own</h2>These aren\u2019t mindless dolls. Each succubus roams the map on her own, guided by goal-driven AI. She\u2019ll seductively engage enemies, drift through danger, and at times come running back to you\u2014needing your help, your touch. Her expressions shift with the moment, adding raw emotion and irresistible allure to her every move.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/2702246b2c0d061909df19fb28e5fcce.poster.avif?t=1755043054\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/2702246b2c0d061909df19fb28e5fcce.webm?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/2702246b2c0d061909df19fb28e5fcce.mp4?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shed Reality. Slip into Pleasure. \u2014 Instantly Switch Between Display and VR</h2>Start in the comfort of your screen, then dive deep into a world of sensual VR with a single touch. Switch freely at any time\u2014no interruptions, no limits. Seamless controls let you surrender to a pleasure-rich fantasy whenever the urge strikes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/4d46572c6c371e20035a025945c87a3e.poster.avif?t=1755043054\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/4d46572c6c371e20035a025945c87a3e.webm?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774200/extras/4d46572c6c371e20035a025945c87a3e.mp4?t=1755043054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>* When playing in VR, the game is designed for seated play. A head-mounted display replaces the monitor, and a single VR controller is used instead of a keyboard and mouse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story \u2014 The Slick Rescue of Desire Begins.</h2>You\u2019re a carefree slime, enjoying steamy days with your playful succubi. But everything changes when a dark realm engulfs their village. Only a teleport crystal remains. Now, it\u2019s up to you to bring them back\u2014one by one\u2014and rebuild your dripping, decadent harem.",
